t round. MEGA TAG PANIC is an online tag game for 2-10 players. The tagger grows bigger every second, the giant can't fit through narrow doors, and whoever is still \"it\" when the round ends is eliminated. With proximity voice chat, you hear the screams and laughs as the tagger gets closer. No friends online? You can play with bots too. The full game launches on ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T20:34:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692656","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:37:08Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5247240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:36Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5247240":"2026-10-26T09:30:36Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5247240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:35Z"},"5275550":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:30:36Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5247240","app_id":5247240,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:42Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"606303bb436fcaadb0f8b1d766c465dffdef439d82ff4ab97ba7d6ad5001c283","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"술래잡기 — 그런데 술래가 계속 커진다. 거대해진 술래는 좁은 문을 못 지나가고, 거기가 네 탈출구다. 따귀를 충전해 빨간 구간에서 놓고, 친구를 날려 버려라. 2~10인, 맵 12개, 모드 6가지, 특수 능력 10가지를 가진 캐릭터 10명. 온라인에 아무도 없다고? 봇은 봐주지 않는다.","publishers":[{"name":"Big Dot Games"}],"developers"